## Each binary package below pulls in the matching Kicksecure LXQt meta
## package (VM = --target virtualbox, baremetal = --target iso) plus the
## DhampirOS branding and artwork. Kicksecure security packages come in through
## those dependencies and are not copied or changed here.
Package: dhampir-vm-gui-lxqt
Architecture: all
Depends: kicksecure-vm-gui-lxqt,
 dhampir-branding,
 dhampiros-artwork,
 dhampiros-motion,
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: DhampirOS VM with LXQt desktop (metapackage)
 Installs the Kicksecure LXQt VM packages with DhampirOS branding and artwork.
 Security and hardening come from the Kicksecure packages it depends on.

Package: dhampir-baremetal-gui-lxqt
Architecture: all
Depends: kicksecure-baremetal-gui-lxqt,
 dhampir-branding,
 dhampiros-artwork,
 dhampiros-motion,
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: DhampirOS baremetal (ISO) with LXQt desktop (metapackage)
 Installs the Kicksecure LXQt baremetal packages with DhampirOS branding
 and artwork.
 Security and hardening come from the Kicksecure packages it depends on.
